          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} to book a sound bath session, ask questions, or reserve a private experience in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#0f1720; /* deep slate */\\n      --card:#071022; /* darker card */\\n      --muted:#98a8b6;\\n      --accent:#8be3d8; /* aquamarine */\\n      --accent-2:#a78bfa; /* lavender */\\n      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --radius:14px;\\n      --maxw:1040px;\\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n      color-scheme: dark;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;}\\n    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#e6f0f2;line-height:1.45;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}\\n\\n    /* floating svg pattern */\\n    .bg-svg{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;opacity:0.28;filter:blur(8px);} \\n\\n    .wrap{position:relative;z-index:5;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:40px auto;padding:32px;}\\n\\n    header.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:#05212a}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:15px;margin:0}\\n    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    nav ul{display:flex;gap:14px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(139,227,216,0.08),rgba(167,139,250,0.06));color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.06)}\\n    nav a:hover{color:#fff}\\n\\n    main.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:28px}\\n\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(3,10,18,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n\\n    .hero{padding:28px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center}\\n    .hero h2{margin:0;font-size:22px}\\n    .hero p{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .lead{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n\\n    form .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:12px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}\\n    input[type=\\\"text\\\"],input[type=\\\"email\\\"],textarea,select{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:inherit;font-size:14px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n\\n    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#05212a;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer}\\n    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* info blocks */\\n    .info-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}\\n    .pill{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:30px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:880px){\\n      main.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .wrap{padding:20px;margin:18px}\\n      .logo{width:46px;height:46px}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <!-- decorative SVG pattern, unique for this page -->\\n  <svg class=\\\"bg-svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 1000 700\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid slice\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n        <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8be3d8\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n        <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#a78bfa\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.08\\\"/>\\n      </linearGradient>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(14)\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"60\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"30\\\" cy=\\\"30\\\" r=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\\\"/>\\n      </pattern>\\n      <filter id=\\\"f1\\\" x=\\\"-20%\\\" y=\\\"-20%\\\" width=\\\"140%\\\" height=\\\"140%\\\">\\n        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"20\\\" result=\\\"b\\\"/>\\n        <feBlend in=\\\"SourceGraphic\\\" in2=\\\"b\\\"/>\\n      </filter>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\"/>\\n    <g filter=\\\"url(#f1)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.7\\\">\\n      <ellipse cx=\\\"200\\\" cy=\\\"120\\\" rx=\\\"340\\\" ry=\\\"140\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n      <ellipse cx=\\\"820\\\" cy=\\\"520\\\" rx=\\\"380\\\" ry=\\\"160\\\" fill=\\\"#6ee7b7\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" />\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Gatherings</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Rates</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">FAQ</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">Reach</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <!-- left column: contact + context -->\\n      <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h2>Reach {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} — Book a session or ask a question</h2>\\n            <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Whether you're reserving a private sound bath, inquiring about corporate sessions, or looking to join the next community gathering, this is the best way to connect.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"POST\\\" novalidate>\\n            <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"source\\\" value=\\\"contact-page\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Jane Doe\\\" required>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"field\\\" style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"field\\\" style=\\\"width:160px\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"type\\\">I am contacting about</label>\\n              <select id=\\\"type\\\" name=\\\"inquiry_type\\\">\\n                <option>Upcoming event / Join waitlist</option>\\n                <option>Private 1:1 session</option>\\n                <option>Couples or group booking</option>\\n                <option>Corporate / workplace offering</option>\\n                <option>Other</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n              <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Preferred dates, questions, accessibility notes, or anything else we should know\\\"></textarea>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n              <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" onclick=\\\"window.location='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'\\\">Book Now</button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <p class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Prefer calling? <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> — or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <hr style=\\\"border:none;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);margin:18px 0;border-radius:2px\\\">\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"info-grid\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n            <strong>Studio / Venue</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{VENUE_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n            <strong>Availability</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Most bookings scheduled within 2–6 weeks. Inquire for expedited reservations.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <footer>\\n          <div><strong>Privacy</strong> — We never share your details. Replies typically within 48 hours.</div>\\n        </footer>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- right column: practical guide + contraindications + what to bring -->\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">On attending a sound bath</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Our approach is sensory-led and intentionally premium: gentle lighting, warm floor surfaces, and carefully curated instruments tuned for restorative resonance.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>What to bring</strong>\\n          <ul style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>Blanket and an extra layer for warmth</li>\\n            <li>A small pillow or yoga bolster for neck support</li>\\n            <li>An eye mask or scarf to block light</li>\\n            <li>Water bottle; avoid heavy meals immediately beforehand</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>Typical flow</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">We begin with gentle grounding and breathwork, followed by a 40–60 minute sound immersion featuring a rotating selection of instruments (for public events we may use crystal bowls, chimes, or tuning forks; private sessions sometimes include gong or monochord). The session closes with soft reorientation and optional sharing.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>Contraindications</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Sound bathing is generally safe but not recommended for people with epilepsy, certain seizure disorders, or those with recent head/neck surgery without medical clearance. If you are pregnant, have a pacemaker, or have significant cardiovascular concerns, please consult your physician and inform us prior to booking.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>Accessibility</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Our venue is wheelchair friendly; please let us know of mobility needs so we can prepare floor space or a chair for you.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Request a Reservation</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // small client-side enhancement: basic form validation and conversion of placeholders\\n    (function(){\\n      var form = document.getElementById('contactForm');\\n      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){\\n        var email = document.getElementById('email').value;\\n        if(!email||!email.includes('@')){\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          alert('Please enter a valid email address so we can reply.');\\n        }\\n      });\\n    })();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Contact page for the sound bath event site (chunk 4).\\n\\nPurpose:\\n- A responsive, accessible contact page for {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. Includes contact form, quick info on what to bring, contraindications, flow description, and a booking CTA.\\n\\nFiles in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — full page ready to drop into your site.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace or process in your deployment system:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}\\n- {{VENUE_NAME}}\\n- {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}\\n\\nNotes:\\n- Visuals are implemented with CSS + an inline SVG pattern so there are no external assets required for this page. If you have a central assets folder, you may swap the inline SVG for assets/img/pattern.svg later.\\n- Form posts to the URL in {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. Adjust method/action as needed for your backend.\\n- The copy intentionally includes sensory and premium language and a concise contraindications section — keep this content visible when adapting the page.\\n\\nDesign tokens & layout family:\\n- layoutFamily: clinic_modern\\n- voiceFamily: practical_guide\\n- offerModel: vip_day\\n\\nUnique notes for this chunk:\\n- Navigation labels use a slightly different wording (\\\"Gatherings\\\", \\\"Reach\\\") to satisfy variant requirements across templates.\\n- Instruments and flow are described but intentionally varied from other pages to maintain uniqueness.\\n\\nSeed & slug (reference):\\n- slug: sound_bath-2026-02-16T11-54-11-695Z-010\\n- seed: 2578698158\\n\\nUsage:\\n- Replace placeholders, upload to your hosting, and wire the form endpoint.\\n- For private-session bookings, link to private-sessions.html or book.html as needed.\\n\\nEnd of README.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
